21. HTML Product Table
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Product Details</title>
</head>
<body>

    <h1>Product Details</h1>

    <table border="1">
        <tr>
            <th>Product ID</th>
            <th>Product Name</th>
            <th>Price</th>
        </tr>

        <tr>
            <td>101</td>
            <td>Laptop</td>
            <td>50000</td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
            <td>102</td>
            <td>Mobile</td>
            <td>20000</td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
            <td>103</td>
            <td>Headphones</td>
            <td>2000</td>
        </tr>
    </table>

</body>
</html>
Output
| Product ID | Product Name | Price |
| ---------: | ------------ | ----: |
|        101 | Laptop       | 50000 |
|        102 | Mobile       | 20000 |
|        103 | Headphones   |  2000 |
